        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú tsár oo waawuti'iimár Asa oo Yuda, Nadabu garmoó Yeroboamu waawuti'iima gana iimu/ún baraá Israeli wa aleero. Inós kureeri ngaa /aáy baraá waawuti'iimaro a tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
