        },
        {
          "text": "Ba'asha garmoó Ahiya, oo tlahhoó Isakari, Nadabu guri gaasár wa slaá'. Ala qoomár Nadabu nee slaqwaruuseerós gixsár Gibetoni ar Filisti kawa harweér, Ba'asha iri haratláy, Nadabu guri gaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
